      "x": 77,
      "y": 1605,
      "w": 583,
      "h": 213
    },
    {
      "text": "Over time, however, this recycling becomes less effective. Damaged components accumulate, senescent cells build up, and mitochondrial efficiency declines. These changes not only drive physical ageing ",
