  "fullText": "Skip to content\nMENU\nCLOSE\nENGLISH\nCONTACT US\nRESERVE YOUR STAY\nWORLD'S BEST DETOX PROGRAMME FOR THE SIXTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR\nDETOX: THE FOUNDATION OF CREATING HEALTH AND LONGEVITY\nCHENOT PALACE WEGGIS\nSIX YEARS AT NO.1 IN DETOXIFICATION. ONE CLEAR REASON.\n\nBy activating cellular pathways rooted in autophagy and re-awakening the body’s natural repair systems, it performs better, ages more slowly, and feels lighter — both mentally and physically. Our approach has just been named World’s Best Detox Programme 2026 for the sixth consecutive year.\n\nDETOXIFICATION AS CELLULAR CLEANUP\n\nFor more than five decades, Chenot has placed detoxification at the core of its philosophy. Detoxification is the foundation of renewal, representing the driving force addressing the twelve hallmarks of aging as well as aging-related cell damage and dysfunction.\n\nBy clearing debris and dysfunctional cells, the body regains its ability to repair, regenerate and thrive. Every day, cells generate waste products as part of normal metabolism. In youth, this waste is efficiently recycled through autophagy—a housekeeping process that removes damaged proteins, faulty mitochondria and other toxic build-up. This ongoing cleanup keeps tissues strong, mitochondria efficient, the immune system sharp, and the brain clear.\n\nOver time, however, this recycling becomes less effective. Damaged components accumulate, senescent cells build up, and mitochondrial efficiency declines. These changes not only drive physical ageing but also fuel inflammation, fatigue, cognitive decline and chronic disease. In this way, the failure of cellular detoxification becomes a root cause of both physical and mental deterioration.\n\nDetoxification at Chenot goes far beyond diet. It is a systemic reset designed to optimise every layer of cellular and physiological function, including:\n\nStructured fasting & FMD — activating autophagy and renewal.\nHydrotherapy and heat treatments — stimulating circulation, lymphatic drainage and toxin elimination. These treatments also induce the activation of heat shock proteins (HSPs), pivotal in mediating autophagy-related benefits and cellular protection.\nBioenergetic therapies — harmonising the autonomic nervous system to restore equilibrium.\nRESERVE YOUR AWARD WINNING DETOX\nTHE SCIENCE BEHIND CHENOT\n\nThe clinical study published in 2025 reveals the unique benefits of Chenot’s plant-based fasting-mimicking diet: \n\nLower IGF-1: Levels decreased, a change associated with slower biological ageing.\nHigher ketones: Beta-hydroxybutyrate (BHB) rose, indicating a flexible, fat-burning metabolism on low-calorie days.\nMore cellular clean-up: Markers of autophagy increased — the body’s process for clearing damaged cell components.\nLongevity genes upregulated: Increased activity of SIRT1 and FOXO1, linked to cellular repair and healthy ageing.\n\nThe findings reinforce Chenot’s position at the forefront of evidence-based wellness, with measurable effects on the key biomarkers of longevity.\n\nDOWNLOAD THE STUDY\n\nSimply complete the form below to receive the full study by email.\n\nSECTION\nEmail Address *\nCHENOT CORE DETOX PROGRAMMES\n\nFind out more about our award winning programmes and book your next stay in one of our facilities.\n\nADVANCED DETOX\nDETOX PROGRAMME\n\nOur signature Chenot programme aims to induce a deep purification and detoxification of the body to eliminate toxins, increase vitality, reset energy levels and rebalance its physiology.\n\nCHF 5’500\n\nVIEW ADVANCED DETOX\nRECOVER & ENERGISE\nDETOX PROGRAMME\n\nRelax your brain, revitalise your body – Chenot’s Recover & Energise programme reduces chronic stress and fatigue which restores optimal energy levels.\n\nCHF 6’400\n\nVIEW RECOVER & ENERGISE\nPREVENTION & AGEING WELL\nDETOX PROGRAMME\n\nChenot’s most intense health span enhancing programme combining our signature detox with high-impact rejuvenation to delay the onset of biological ageing.\n\nCHF 7’100\n\nVIEW PREVENTION & AGEING WELL\nRESERVE YOUR AWARD WINNING DETOX\nCONNECT WITH US\n\nStay up to date on all the latest Chenot news. By signing up, you accept the Terms & Conditions of Chenot’s Privacy Policy.\n\nSECTION\nEmail Address *\nFacebook-f\n \nInstagram\n \nLinkedin-in\n \nYoutube\n \nX-twitter\nCHENOT PALACE\nWEGGIS, SWITZERLAND\nGABALA, AZERBAIJAN\nCHENOT ESPACE\nL’ALBERETA, ITALY\nPORTONOVI, MONTENEGRO\nCHENOT SPA\nMARRAKECH, MOROCCO\nCHENOT GROUP\nABOUT CHENOT\nTHE CHENOT METHOD ®\nTHE CHENOT DIET ®\nCHENOT PRODUCTS\nEXCLUSIVE EXPERIENCES\nBUSINESS DEVELOPMENT\nMORE INFORMATION\nCONTACT US\nNEWS & FEATURES\nBROCHURE\nPRESS & AWARDS\nCAREERS\nPRIVACY POLICY\nTERMS & CONDITIONS\n© 1974 – 2026 CHENOT GROUP"
